<section class="card flex flex-col gap-5 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center"><div class="flex-1"><h2 class="font-bold">1. Ativar agenda</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Permita que clientes agendem serviços pela sua agenda online.</p></div><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-3"><input class="toggle sr-only" type="checkbox" name="agenda_ativa" <?php echo (int) $agenda['agenda_ativa'] === 1 ? 'checked' : ''; ?>><span class="relative h-6 w-11 rounded-full bg-slate-300 after:absolute after:left-1 after:top-1 after:h-4 after:w-4 after:rounded-full after:bg-white after:transition"></span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700">Agenda ativada</span></label></section>
<section class="card p-5"><h2 class="font-bold">2. Duração média do atendimento</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Esta duração será usada para criar os horários disponíveis.</p><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><?php foreach ([30 => '30 min', 60 => '1 hora', 90 => '1h 30 min', 120 => '2 horas'] as $value => $label): ?><label class="choice cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold"><input class="sr-only" name="duracao_minutos" type="radio" value="<?php echo $value; ?>" <?php echo (int) $agenda['duracao_minutos'] === $value ? 'checked' : ''; ?>><?php echo $label; ?></label><?php endforeach; ?></div></section>
<section class="card p-5"><h2 class="font-bold">3. Dias e horários de atendimento</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Marque os dias em que você atende e ajuste o horário de cada um.</p><div class="mt-4 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4"><?php foreach ($week as $day => $label): $h = $agenda['hours'][(string) $day]; ?><label class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-3"><input type="checkbox" name="active_<?php echo $day; ?>" <?php echo !empty($h['active']) ? 'checked' : ''; ?>><span class="w-8 text-sm font-bold"><?php echo $label; ?></span><input type="time" name="start_<?php echo $day; ?>" value="<?php echo htmlspecialchars($h['start'], ENT_QUOTES, 'UTF-8'); ?>" class="rounded border border-slate-200 px-1 py-1 text-xs"><span class="text-slate-400">–</span><input type="time" name="end_<?php echo $day; ?>" value="<?php echo htmlspecialchars($h['end'], ENT_QUOTES, 'UTF-8'); ?>" class="rounded border border-slate-200 px-1 py-1 text-xs"></label><?php endforeach; ?></div></section>
<section class="card p-5"><h2 class="font-bold">4. Intervalo entre serviços</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Tempo livre entre um atendimento e outro.</p><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><?php foreach ([0 => '0 min', 15 => '15 min', 30 => '30 min', 45 => '45 min', 60 => '60 min'] as $value => $label): ?><label class="choice cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold"><input class="sr-only" name="intervalo_minutos" type="radio" value="<?php echo $value; ?>" <?php echo (int) $agenda['intervalo_minutos'] === $value ? 'checked' : ''; ?>><?php echo $label; ?></label><?php endforeach; ?></div></section>
<section class="card p-5"><h2 class="font-bold">5. Antecedência mínima</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Prazo que o cliente deve respeitar antes de agendar.</p><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><?php foreach ([30 => '30 min', 60 => '1 hora', 120 => '2 horas', 1440 => '1 dia', 2880 => '2 dias'] as $value => $label): ?><label class="choice cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold"><input class="sr-only" name="antecedencia_minutos" type="radio" value="<?php echo $value; ?>" <?php echo (int) $agenda['antecedencia_minutos'] === $value ? 'checked' : ''; ?>><?php echo $label; ?></label><?php endforeach; ?></div></section>
<section class="card p-5"><h2 class="font-bold">6. Confirmação de agendamentos</h2><div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2"><label class="choice cursor-pointer rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4"><input class="sr-only" name="confirmacao" type="radio" value="auto" <?php echo empty($agenda['confirmacao_manual']) ? 'checked' : ''; ?>><span class="font-bold">Confirmação automática</span><span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-slate-500">O agendamento é confirmado assim que o cliente finalizar.</span></label><label class="choice cursor-pointer rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4"><input class="sr-only" name="confirmacao" type="radio" value="manual" <?php echo !empty($agenda['confirmacao_manual']) ? 'checked' : ''; ?>><span class="font-bold">Confirmação manual</span><span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-slate-500">Você aprova o agendamento antes de confirmar para o cliente.</span></label></div></section>
